  "ingredients": [
    "1 pound Snow Crab clusters, thawed if necessary",
    "0.25 cup butter",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "1.5 teaspoons dried parsley",
    "0.25 teaspoon freshly ground black pepper",
    "0.125 teaspoon salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Cut a slit, length-wise, into the shell of each piece of crab.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ZO3XcAXkuiaFqMHD0KZRLWIzpzo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/155375-CrabLegsWithGarlicButterSauce-mfs-Step1-1659-4x3-6525e998d44c40a28b3dec64b7a1d7a5.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155375/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Melt butter in a large skillet over medium heat. Add garlic and cook until translucent, 1 to 2 minutes. Stir in parsley, pepper, and salt. Continue to heat mixture until bubbling.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/LFudNRsb18Klcg2HMMiFawn9pNo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/155375-CrabLegsWithGarlicButterSauce-mfs-Step2-1660-4x3-61c57a19d9724736bab6fc316fd68a30.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155375/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add crab legs to the skillet; toss to coat with butter mixture. Simmer until completely heated through, 5 to 6 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Lnbotnst0Bk3UO2umJbb4jPEbrc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/155375-CrabLegsWithGarlicButterSauce-mfs-Step3-1666-4x3-88edc3bf580942cabbcacd0297637a64.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/155375/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve hot and enjoy!",
